abstract: >-
  A source-pinned finite cocycle certificate and a written all-degree explicit
  twisted bar homotopy, supported by exact bounded tensor replay and rejecting
  controls. The finite cochain is checked by two polynomial implementations;
  the new tensor checker reuses the predecessor arithmetic explicitly.
  OpenAI supplied the construction and Pico the earlier algebra check.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance and AI review are disclosed.
  The full Auslander-Reiten counterexample remains outside scope.
